Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tch-tch-tch. Oh, here, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能开门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you open the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去看看能不能找到一些物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goin' out to see if we can find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们来时给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}for when they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我无法胜任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe I'd be up to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来一点不奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在为他们修这个便携式音频系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm repairin' this portable audio system for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.59,0:03:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来时 我们会有一个很体面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a perfectly respectable music player.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐播放器\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做有把握的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dealing in certainties,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在尽力提供他们想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm doing my part to give them what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当 当 当 当 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dun-dun-dun dun ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猪 小猪 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little pig, little pig, let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you better be jokin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根 露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan, Lucille.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我得留下深刻的第一印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I had to make a pretty strong first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我开口问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not make me have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Rick, come on out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是轻而易举\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy peasy lemon squeezy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大日子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你看见我刚做的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick, you see that, what I just did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是上好服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is some service!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点被拒之门外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we almost get turned away at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who is that guy, anyway?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生气了吗 发脾气了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I get mad? Do I throw a fit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.81,0:06:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我砸了哪个红毛的头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I bash some ginger's dome in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是干掉了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just take care of one of these dead pricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能杀死你们的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could've killed one of y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:29.42,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot diggity dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方真是了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如俗话说 富得流油\N{\fnArial\fs30}An embarrassment of riches, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我相信你们肯定有许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, I do believe you are gonna have plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可提供的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to offer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, hey …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:07:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't talk to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我要你砍掉他身体的某个部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't make you chop anything off of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same goes for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.59,0:08:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才悬念很多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of suspense there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都不知道有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she even knew how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们橱柜里有什么好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what kind of goodies you got in the cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分好了一半补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We put aside half the supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:08:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权决定我们拿走什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't decide what we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到老大的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就搜一搜房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just gonna search the houses a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续搜刮\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep the process movin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要带我在这里转转吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna show me around or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你的朋友去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going with your friend here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打算去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just heading back to …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.91,0:10:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that that's all settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有份工作给你做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a job for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把达里尔的摩托弄过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get me Daryl's bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it ain't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道它在哪里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you know where it is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩都清楚你是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know you know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别花太长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种场景让我满意极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the kind of thing that just tickles my balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一切都特别舒心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything is pleasant as punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 一旦你们了解了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, we really are reasonable people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会发现我们真的特别讲道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you get to know us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很诚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠 我真爱这地方 - 尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn, I love this place! - Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会想看看这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somethin' you might wanna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞧瞧这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望是什么变态小视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my fingers crossed for a little freaky-deaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数都数不清 - 老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't even know how many by now. - Jee-hee-sus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道为什么他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know why they're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你吗 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you, Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那张胡子拉碴的脸 - 只有他们死了 我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- underneath all that man-bush? - They're dead so my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和外面那些人才能活下去 - 我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- all those people out there, can be alive. - Shee-ot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不敢惹那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have messed with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.07,0:15:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你已经不是那个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not you anymore…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真得刮刮胡子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really gotta shave this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个生病的姑娘怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to that sick girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚对她而言压力可大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seemed like a hell of a stressful night for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当时那哭闹的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way she was carrying on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她是二号的老婆 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was married to number two, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意自己看我的眼神 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful how you're lookin' at me, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,寡妇 特别是那些长成她那样的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Widows, especially ones that look like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们…很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}they…are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们的丈夫去世之后 她们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after their husbands go, they are just…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,身边就没人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}empty side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这种情况不会持续太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}But usually not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would love to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去祭奠她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you care to pay your respects?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho-ly crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太他妈渗人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are creepy as shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,悄悄摸摸地靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}sneaking up on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴着罗马领 脸上挂着诡异的微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}wearin' that collar with that freaky-ass smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:16:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是加百利神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Father Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没挺过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是场悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定很难过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this must really suck for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.27,0:17:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那算在我头上 我当时别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was on me. No choice there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须给你们个教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lessons had to be learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}But number two?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是必须得死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That didn't need to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 是他逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, there, he forced my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那大概把她压垮了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably put her right on her back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来打算让她和我一起回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna ask her to come back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know what you're thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能赢得她的芳心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I have a shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个把她丈夫的头打碎了的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}guy that just bashed her husband's head in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对想不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人啊 他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, people, they …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放一些回去 不然下一颗就打你身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put some back or the next one goes in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得接下来会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 卡尔 把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, Carl, put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 他拿走了我们所有的药品\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's taking all of our medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说了只拿一半的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said only half our stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要这样吗 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁你们还没领教到我们是多危险的人之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you find out how dangerous we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, pardon me, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思我他妈爆粗了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse the shit out of my goddamn French, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚是威胁了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you just threaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我理解你为什么威胁戴维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get threatening Davey here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能容忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能威胁他 不能威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.32,0:19:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 放下枪 - 别无礼 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl, just put it down. - Don't be rude, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在谈话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are having a conversation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 我们说到哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, boy, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是胆大包天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your giant, man-sized balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别威胁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No threatening us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不想用暴力证明什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I don't want to go hard proving a point here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前说了一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said half your shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一半是我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}and half is what I say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我证明我有多认真吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to prove how serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗瑞克 这一切都在提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Rick, this whole thing reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的枪太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have a lot of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你们从我的哨站抢来的一批枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's all the guns you took from my outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你们用来干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you wasted all my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哨站人的一大批自己的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a shit-ton of your own guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌你们还有更多枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm bettin' there's even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,加起来一共…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which adds up to an absolute…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是超他妈多的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}ass-load of guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这种情绪小爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as this little emotional outburst.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经明确地证明了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}just made crystal clear…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我不能允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在枪都归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么告诉我 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me, Rick…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的枪在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…figured you were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他去看枪 奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him where the guns are, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器库在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The armory's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.67,0:21:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责管理这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run the show in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只负责记录所有东西 配给口粮 枪支\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just keep track of it all, the rations, the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我耽误你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let me stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去 小伙子们 看看物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her out, boys. Show 'em the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们忙的同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}While they're at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想对你说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to point out to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会拿一丁点你的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'm not taking a scrap of your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里不会多拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slim pickin's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且肯定不只有我注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't be the only one to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.31,0:21:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让一个胖女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you got a fat lady in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:21:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责管理口粮 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of keeping track of rations, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 你们饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, you starve to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.93,0:22:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就什么也得不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.13,0:22:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以目前呢 你可以保留所有食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}so for now, you get to keep all the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.85,0:22:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.84,0:22:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,道声谢怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.61,0:22:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得不该这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that might be in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要求太过分了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is that too much to ask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们起了个坏头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we started off on the wrong foot,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我又能说什么呢 是你逼我的 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what can I say? You forced my hand, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直努力想让你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's like I've been tryin' to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你和我合作 我还是很讲道理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a very reasonable man as long as you cooperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我来问你个问题 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let me ask you a question, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:22:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在和我合作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you cooperating?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.09,0:23:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来像什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这看起来像什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真正想知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I really want to know is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能否能在后面找到所有枪支\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're gonna find all the guns back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.69,0:23:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说你私藏了一些 在等待时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if maybe you got a few just waitin' for their moment…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我的露西尔一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like my Lucille.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪都在这里了 就我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all in there, to the best of my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.24,0:23:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am countin' on that, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.41,0:24:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这样做很逊 但你也看到局面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know this sucks, but you saw what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.83,0:24:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他们今天来了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw how many of them are there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.65,0:24:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了 都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our life now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.25,0:25:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克把我们带上了这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where Rick got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.65,0:25:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许如果瑞克能深思熟虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if Rick thought it through,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.66,0:25:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would've been different.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.06,0:25:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人也许还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}People might still be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.88,0:25:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须学会接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got to learn to live with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.77,0:25:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.23,0:25:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 瑞克 今天是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what today is, Rick? Today is a banner day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.07,0:25:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.01,0:25:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为咱俩的小协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this little arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.35,0:25:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定能行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have is gonna work out just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.68,0:25:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.13,0:26:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你有没有好好保养我的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if you've been taking care of my guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.04,0:26:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.25,0:26:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信露西尔会有点嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I do believe Lucille's gettin' a little jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.42,0:26:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ho-ly smokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.24,0:26:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你们把蒂米和迪克小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you guys that took out Little Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.34,0:26:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Dick Brigade?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.10,0:26:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.02,0:26:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后过把瘾啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gettin' in your last licks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.12,0:26:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让我有不少乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, man, I'm gonna have some fun with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I-I don't know for …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.53,0:26:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉特 不要那么粗鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat, we don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.51,0:27:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless they do somethin' to deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.64,0:27:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们查了库存单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we went through the inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.51,0:27:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了武器库里的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns in the armory,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙边的枪 还少几把\N{\fnArial\fs30}guns they had around the walls, they're short.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.86,0:27:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,格洛克9和一支点22山猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glock 9 and a.22 Bobcat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.97,0:27:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有人离开了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had some people leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能带着那些枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guns probably went with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.37,0:27:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以奥利维亚搞砸了她的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Olivia sucks at her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.29,0:27:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想说这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you're sayin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.27,0:27:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm not sayin' that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.45,0:27:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,库存单应该统计完整 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be a full accounting here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不遗巨细\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.37,0:27:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说的对吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.87,0:27:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.93,0:27:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,库存单是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inventory is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.14,0:27:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.64,0:27:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not so good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.58,0:27:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 上面记的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, what's in here…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.31,0:27:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不在里面 少了两把手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't in there. You're two handguns short.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.65,0:27:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.69,0:28:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人沮丧 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's dappointing, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.83,0:28:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们已经达成共识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that we had an understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.29,0:28:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这事 说明有人有异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this … well, this shows that someone's not on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.27,0:28:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我不能允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.86,0:28:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢杀女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't enjoy killing women.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.17,0:28:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人 我想杀多少杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men … I can waste them all the live long.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.57,0:28:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但归根结底 亲爱的奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at the end of the day, Olivia, my dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你的责任 - 这个我们可以解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}- this was your responsibility. - Look, we can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.15,0:28:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且现在我正要去解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm going to … right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.12,0:28:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的工作 而你搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your job, and you screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.08,0:28:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录枪支情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping track of guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.04,0:28:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.06,0:29:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,事关生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}is life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.05,0:29:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过藏一些枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about hiding some of the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.79,0:29:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前藏过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.78,0:29:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过可以埋一些在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured I could bury some out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.93,0:29:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们很多年都不会碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we don't touch them for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.18,0:29:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.61,0:29:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.74,0:29:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果救世军发现了那些枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if the Saviors find those guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.40,0:29:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们带着那些枪遇到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we run into them when we have those guns on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.93,0:29:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中一个就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.08,0:29:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还不止一个 也许会死很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe more than that. Maybe a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们有多少子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter how many bullets we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.51,0:29:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是不够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.14,0:30:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们赢了 事实就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They win. It's that black-and-white.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.11,0:30:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏枪不是解决方法 再也不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding a couple of guns isn't the answer, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.00,0:30:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必心甘情愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.07,0:30:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得把枪交给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to give them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.92,0:30:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把格洛克9和一把点22\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Glock 9 and a.22.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.04,0:30:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们在找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.87,0:30:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在谁那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.15,0:30:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone knows where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.48,0:30:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者知道在谁那吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they know who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们找不到 他们就会杀了奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't find them, they're gonna kill Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们干得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.57,0:30:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do they care?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.23,0:30:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,两把枪又不能威胁到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two guns aren't a threat to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.56,0:30:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些枪可以保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those guns could help protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.23,0:30:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,免受外来人的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}from whatever else is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.53,0:30:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪在你那吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.82,0:30:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒希望在我这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.53,0:31:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人当时不在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of you weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.25,0:31:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不必看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们现在可以无视他人的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can look away now when someone else dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.54,0:31:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你们可以帮忙解决这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can help solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.10,0:31:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们想要的 我们就能和平地生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We give them what they want, and we live in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.83,0:31:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.73,0:31:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.88,0:31:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.72,0:31:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设我们找到了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say we find the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.84,0:31:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后我们该怎么摆脱这困境 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna get out of this, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.89,0:31:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.15,0:31:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来给你们明确说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me put this to all of you as clearly as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.38,0:31:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,管事的不再是我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in charge anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.19,0:31:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 枪在谁那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who has the guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.94,0:32:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人都来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.20,0:32:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.66,0:32:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.99,0:33:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.03,0:33:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出来就是为了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why you're out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.83,0:33:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了丹妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.50,0:33:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.27,0:33:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是满的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if it was full?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.33,0:33:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.36,0:33:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.85,0:33:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里那个混蛋收走我们的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That asshole back there took our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.50,0:33:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他要收走我们所有的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he's gonna take all our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.03,0:33:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.18,0:34:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么做 告诉他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.36,0:34:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not our life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:34:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.08,0:34:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.81,0:35:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.79,0:35:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.58,0:35:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道会顺利过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is going to work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.96,0:35:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.69,0:35:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会熬过今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get through today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.04,0:35:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后找到继续前进的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll find a way to go forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.95,0:35:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to beat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有办法抗争的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no beating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.33,0:35:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的 总有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there is, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.22,0:35:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我们有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have faith in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.53,0:35:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.45,0:35:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.07,0:35:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.91,0:35:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.02,0:35:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非一直是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't always that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.96,0:35:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩呢 她有没有可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Michonne? Could she possibly have …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.53,0:35:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她手上没有他们要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have anything they're lookin' for.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.07,0:35:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挖的那个坟墓 很机智\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did with the graves, it was quick thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.50,0:35:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.96,0:36:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴挖一个没人睡的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nice digging a grave I knew would stay empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.82,0:36:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没找到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.39,0:36:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们搜了罗西塔的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We searched the house, Rosita's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.13,0:36:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.39,0:36:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.59,0:36:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪最有可能藏在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they were anywhere, they'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞干过类似的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer's done this kind of thing before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.23,0:36:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.38,0:36:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许今天会找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe today works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.02,0:36:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.90,0:36:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再去看看迪安娜的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look in Deanna's office again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.09,0:37:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,气球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balloons?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.70,0:37:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去派对吗 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going to a party, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.51,0:37:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能留着吗 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I keep them, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.23,0:37:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.36,0:37:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我留下这些吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.78,0:37:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍拜托 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say please again, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.64,0:37:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.62,0:38:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.85,0:38:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.41,0:38:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.23,0:38:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很快就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be gone soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.46,0:38:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我带了什么 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got for me, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.55,0:38:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.03,0:38:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该来的还是来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.96,0:38:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有意思 一句「我的天 有人会死」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny how a little "Holy shit! Somebody's gonna die!"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.97,0:38:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能刺激所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}lights a fire under everybody's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.49,0:38:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 瑞克 你们中哪一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, Rick … which one of your fine folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.23,0:38:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点要了奥利维亚的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost cost Olivia the rest of her days?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.10,0:38:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不重要 - 不 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't matter anymore. - No, it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.47,0:39:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让所有人都同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you need to get everybody on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.71,0:39:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 不然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody. Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.95,0:39:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又要回到原点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just go right back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.23,0:40:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这地方真不错啊 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a place you got here, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.70,0:40:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.73,0:40:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.31,0:40:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, can you just…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.80,0:40:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}give me a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.27,0:41:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我拿着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had me hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.51,0:41:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,步枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.59,0:41:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.94,0:41:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道在包里装着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.02,0:41:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在外面做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.54,0:41:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在外面做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在练枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.75,0:41:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把枪都交出去 所有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to give up our guns, all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.52,0:41:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.54,0:41:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你把枪藏起来 让他们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you keep it, and they find it,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.79,0:41:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.14,0:41:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要失去你 或者卡尔 或者其他任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not losing you or Carl or anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.77,0:41:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再失去任何人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not losing anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.17,0:41:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把枪交给他们 你让我做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm giving it to them. Are you gonna let me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.76,0:42:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.03,0:42:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为她去找补给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she was scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.40,0:42:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她其实是去打猎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.84,0:42:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这支枪没入过库 我们一直在防线上用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one never came inside. We kept it near the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.54,0:42:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看阿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.19,0:42:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,关系就该这么建起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is something to build a relationship on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.50,0:42:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是听进去读懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is readin' the room and gettin' the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.18,0:42:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前说过 我要再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've said it before, I'm gonna say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.87,0:42:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个人呢 很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, sir…are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.02,0:42:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你知道了我们会守规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you know we can follow your rules…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.07,0:42:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.36,0:42:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想求你留下达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'd like to ask you if Daryl can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.09,0:42:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not happenin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.00,0:42:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.69,0:43:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许达里尔可以自己求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Daryl can plead his case.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.82,0:43:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他会说动我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Daryl can sway me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.58,0:43:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.46,0:43:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.88,0:43:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要做的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.81,0:43:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻过你们的高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}is get over that tall wall of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.22,0:43:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面加倍努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try harder out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.59,0:43:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earn for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.96,0:43:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们很快就会回来的 到那时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're coming back soon, and when we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.16,0:43:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好拿出点能让我们感兴趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you better have something interesting for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.17,0:43:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 露西尔会按她的方式来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Lucille, she's gonna have her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.49,0:43:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再提醒你一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to hear that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.14,0:43:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有拿出让我们感兴趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't have something interesting for us…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.88,0:43:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.66,0:43:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再出现神奇的枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no more magic guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.12,0:44:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉特 带上鹿 天色晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat, grab that deer. It's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.27,0:44:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.86,0:44:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢请我吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I love a gal that buys me dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.56,0:44:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不用我费心的姑娘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and doesn't expect me to put out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.77,0:44:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.51,0:44:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.95,0:44:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你准备了个小感谢礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a little thank-you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.98,0:44:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you're getting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.33,0:44:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿走了全部的枪 大部分床垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took all your guns, most of your beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.22,0:44:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你美丽的小脑袋能找到地方躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you find a place to lay your pretty little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.54,0:44:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面找到其他东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything else out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.64,0:44:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你死去的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just your dead friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.74,0:45:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.59,0:45:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你说那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.01,0:45:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, nobody died.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.99,0:45:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我怎么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.24,0:45:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得咱俩加强了彼此的理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you and I, we've refined our understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.66,0:45:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问问你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.52,0:45:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让我走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.83,0:46:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that'd be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.77,0:46:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说那两个神奇的字吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then just say those two magical words.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.38,0:46:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.29,0:46:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别搞笑了 应该我谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be ridiculous. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.57,0:46:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.92,0:46:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.28,0:46:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维 把那个烛台给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Davey, hand me that candlestick over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.53,0:46:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想的吗 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.68,0:46:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们各取所需 都会是赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're both gonna come out of this winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.18,0:46:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch my form!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.69,0:47:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.26,0:47:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,双赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.89,0:47:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它洗好等我下次用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should clean that up for me for next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.24,0:47:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.38,0:47:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.24,0:47:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太粗心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How careless of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.52,0:47:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会以为我要丢下露西尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think I was gonna leave Lucille, did ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.27,0:47:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的所作所为之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, after what she did,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.63,0:47:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么会想要她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would you want 'er?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.51,0:47:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们这么配合 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for being so accommodating, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.33,0:48:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you haven't caught on…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.90,0:48:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚把鸡巴塞进了你的嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just slipped my dick down your throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.12,0:48:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还为此感谢了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you thanked me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.80,0:49:05.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到亚历山大安全区 迷途者的天堂 掠夺者的地狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.98,0:49:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.39,0:49:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿走了你屋里的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took the guns you had in your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.71,0:49:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军想要我们全部的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors wanted ours, all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.46,0:49:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,库存单上有两把不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were two missing from the inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.20,0:49:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要杀了奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gonna kill Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.54,0:49:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进了我屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went into my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.12,0:50:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要杀了奥利维亚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gonna kill Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.68,0:50:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不怪你藏枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not faulting you for having the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.54,0:50:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也干过 但是食品和酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it myself. But the food and liquor?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.21,0:50:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你很卑鄙 斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause you're small, Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.65,0:50:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.39,0:50:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在墙里算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got lucky with the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.20,0:50:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我们算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got lucky with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.47,0:50:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该趁有机会的时候和他们谈协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should've made a deal with them when we could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.32,0:50:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们真走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, we're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.37,0:50:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我们来到了乐土\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've led us all to the Promised Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.15,0:50:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Rick?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.44,0:50:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜格伦和亚伯拉罕也很走运吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess Glenn and Abraham were lucky, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.14,0:50:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再敢对我说类似的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say anything like that again to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.68,0:50:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就打烂你的臭嘴 敲掉你的牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll break your jaw, knock your teeth out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.77,0:50:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.83,0:51:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.51,0:51:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.10,0:51:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.90,0:51:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.18,0:51:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前为什么不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me after I …
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.47,0:51:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我为拿到一把枪做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what I did to get one,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.31,0:51:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I need bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.22,0:51:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我藏了有段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had them for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.23,0:51:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不信任瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't trust Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.89,0:51:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他管事让我担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I was worried about him being in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.13,0:51:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.46,0:51:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't have to be our life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.19,0:52:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿走了我们的床垫 大部分都拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took our mattresses … most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.77,0:52:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.85,0:52:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从他们哨站抢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was one of theirs from the outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.75,0:52:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,单子上没有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't have a list?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.52,0:52:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh-unh.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.29,0:53:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,本可以藏更多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could've hidden more.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.68,0:53:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你藏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.48,0:53:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.88,0:53:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到的一切 都是抗争得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we have, we got from fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.45,0:53:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做出选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.12,0:53:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们人不够 这是人数问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't enough of us. It's about numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.32,0:53:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有山顶寨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.33,0:53:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人数依然更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd still have the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.20,0:53:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遵守他们的规则 就能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We play by their rules, and we get some kind of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.05,0:53:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个活法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a life?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.72,0:53:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾有个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I had a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.01,0:54:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没提起过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't talk about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.46,0:54:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.20,0:54:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾变后 他把洛莉和卡尔带到了安全地\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got Lori and Carl to safety right after it all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.17,0:54:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法做到 我当时在医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't. I was in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.76,0:54:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't know… what was happenin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.65,0:54:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.65,0:54:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他名字叫肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.46,0:54:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, him and Lori…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.57,0:54:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were together.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.37,0:54:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.75,0:54:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道朱迪思不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Judith isn't mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.58,0:54:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.80,0:54:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.22,0:54:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.91,0:54:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她不是我骨肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she isn't mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.05,0:55:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须接受这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.93,0:55:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.17,0:55:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就能保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I could keep her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.88,0:55:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不死她就不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll die before she does,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.47,0:55:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望那会是很久以后的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I hope that's a long time from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.54,0:55:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.66,0:55:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抚养她长大 保护她 教她求生\N{\fnArial\fs30}raise her and protect her and teach her how to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.34,0:55:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们现在的生存方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we live now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.81,0:55:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也必须接受这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to accept that, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.24,0:55:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,以保护所有人活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I could keep everyone else alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.51,0:55:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人死不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault when people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.90,0:55:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不总是 但是有时候是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not always, but sometimes … sometimes it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.17,0:55:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to accept this …
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.64,0:55:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of us do …
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.20,0:55:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.56,0:56:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.09,0:58:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我做颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me a bullet.
